.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-report 1  "mnnn-report 2.1.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-report \- Reports for people: text, records, series, journals, projects and authors, exported as PDF, Word, HTML, LaTeX, JSON or CSV
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn report\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reports for people: text, records, series, journals, projects and authors, exported as PDF, Word, HTML, LaTeX, JSON or CSV
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mnnn\-report\-list(1)
List reports
.TP
mnnn\-report\-create(1)
Create a report (optionally in a project)
.TP
mnnn\-report\-show(1)
Show a report\*(Aqs sections (\-\-json: the definition)
.TP
mnnn\-report\-edit(1)
Rename a report or change its description
.TP
mnnn\-report\-remove(1)
Remove a report (and its place in projects)
.TP
mnnn\-report\-add(1)
Add a section: text, records, series, a journal, a project, authors or code output
.TP
mnnn\-report\-edit\-section(1)
Change a section\*(Aqs title, text, format or rows
.TP
mnnn\-report\-remove\-section(1)
Remove a section
.TP
mnnn\-report\-move(1)
Move a section to another position
.TP
mnnn\-report\-export(1)
Export a report with the data as it is now
.TP
mnnn\-report\-preview(1)
Print a report as text in the terminal
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.1.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
